  "releaseNotes": "0.7.5 makes lossy WebP faster (about 30% faster encoding and 8–11% faster decoding on one thread) and the load, orient, convert to sRGB, resize and save path about 40% faster with fewer allocations; it also fixes rare run-to-run differences in multi-threaded lossy WebP encoding. Decoded pixels, encoded bytes and processing results are otherwise unchanged; no public API changes. Notes: https://github.com/art-ix/PictureSharp/blob/v0.7.5/docs/releases/release-0.7.5.md",
